	<li data-footnote-id="rau1f" id="footnote-1"><a href="#footnote-marker-1-1">&#12288;</a> <cite><a href="https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?Pcode=A0000001&amp;FLNO=80">&#25010;&#27861;&#31532;80&#26781;&#35215;&#23450;</a>&#12290;</cite></li>
